WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.343
You would play drinking games too?

00:00:01.343 --> 00:00:05.090
We would, not on set, but we
played this brilliant game

00:00:05.090 --> 00:00:07.962
called tequila slaps, does
anyone know tequila slaps?

00:00:07.962 --> 00:00:08.795
No?

00:00:08.795 --> 00:00:10.280
It's just an X-Men thing.

00:00:10.280 --> 00:00:11.113
Yeah.

00:00:11.113 --> 00:00:11.950
You wanna play?

00:00:11.950 --> 00:00:13.610
Yeah, they said you wanted to do something

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:15.084
with me, I don't know
what it is but I'll--

00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:15.917
I really wanna play this game.

00:00:15.917 --> 00:00:17.810
But I will do it if
you walk me through it.

00:00:17.810 --> 00:00:22.260
Okay, so basically two people
stand opposite one another.

00:00:22.260 --> 00:00:26.140
One person takes a shot
and before they have time

00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:28.902
to swallow it, the other person
slaps them around the face.

00:00:28.902 --> 00:00:30.585
(audience laughing)

00:00:30.585 --> 00:00:34.137
(audience cheering)

00:00:34.137 --> 00:00:35.810
All right.

00:00:35.810 --> 00:00:36.944
Did you bring, you brought some?

00:00:36.944 --> 00:00:40.497
To call that a game seems--
I know, I don't know.

00:00:40.497 --> 00:00:41.673
It's more of a kink than a game.

00:00:41.673 --> 00:00:44.284
I don't know how it's a, I
honestly don't how it's a game.

00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:47.284
(audience cheering)

00:00:49.120 --> 00:00:50.630
And I'll just pour one for myself

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.778
'cause I'm getting on a flight
and I'd like to get drunk.

00:00:52.778 --> 00:00:53.611
Yeah, just do one for yourself.

00:00:53.611 --> 00:00:55.740
And you can have one too.
Oh thank you.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:00:57.740
So Andy just gets to have a drink

00:00:57.740 --> 00:00:58.573
probably without getting.

00:00:58.573 --> 00:00:59.406
That's a big one.

00:00:59.406 --> 00:01:00.700
So wait, so okay.

00:01:00.700 --> 00:01:01.819
This is the game.

00:01:01.819 --> 00:01:02.870
Yeah, yeah.

00:01:02.870 --> 00:01:03.703
Yeah.

00:01:03.703 --> 00:01:04.652
Is it I take this?

00:01:04.652 --> 00:01:06.897
I already know who the winner is.

00:01:06.897 --> 00:01:07.830
Hold on.

00:01:07.830 --> 00:01:09.830
The winner is you because
you get to, should we stand?

00:01:09.830 --> 00:01:10.663
Please stand.

00:01:10.663 --> 00:01:11.496
Okay.

00:01:11.496 --> 00:01:12.840
You're nice and tall, I like that.

00:01:12.840 --> 00:01:13.673
Thank you.

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.458
Okay.
So you take the shot.

00:01:15.458 --> 00:01:17.930
Okay, and how much time do I get?

00:01:17.930 --> 00:01:18.763
Just go?

00:01:18.763 --> 00:01:19.596
Not much time.

00:01:20.572 --> 00:01:23.872
(crowd cheering)

00:01:23.872 --> 00:01:25.470
I'm sorry!

00:01:25.470 --> 00:01:28.220
(crowd clapping)

00:01:31.050 --> 00:01:31.883
Wow!

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:35.168
Wow!

00:01:35.168 --> 00:01:36.141
That was a slap.

00:01:36.141 --> 00:01:37.058
That was,

00:01:37.907 --> 00:01:40.536
that was a fantastic slap!

00:01:40.536 --> 00:01:43.220
(crowd cheering)

00:01:43.220 --> 00:01:44.239
That was really hard.

00:01:44.239 --> 00:01:45.072
That was--

00:01:45.072 --> 00:01:45.905
I'm sorry.

00:01:45.905 --> 00:01:46.802
No, that's,

00:01:46.802 --> 00:01:49.003
(laughing)

00:01:49.003 --> 00:01:50.520
wow!

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:51.737
While she's looking that
way, I'm gonna drink this.

00:01:51.737 --> 00:01:54.570
(laughing)

00:01:54.570 --> 00:01:56.843
Man, you don't screw around.

00:01:58.940 --> 00:02:00.843
I don't screw around.
No, you don't screw around.

00:02:00.843 --> 00:02:04.114
No, I once had a purple
hand mark on my face

00:02:04.114 --> 00:02:05.360
from playing that game.

00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:07.481
And then I came on your show the next day.

00:02:07.481 --> 00:02:10.690
Have you hit someone that
hard playing this game before?

00:02:10.690 --> 00:02:11.840
Harder.

00:02:11.840 --> 00:02:13.620
We go really, really hard with each other.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:16.090
Now are men slapping you in this game?

00:02:16.090 --> 00:02:16.923
Are men slapping you?

00:02:16.923 --> 00:02:17.903
Or is it?

00:02:17.903 --> 00:02:20.660
I mean, you give them permission, yes.

00:02:20.660 --> 00:02:21.493
Wow.

00:02:21.493 --> 00:02:22.326
Yeah.

00:02:22.326 --> 00:02:23.434
That's quite a workplace.

00:02:23.434 --> 00:02:26.287
(laughing)

00:02:26.287 --> 00:02:27.173
But they go gently.

00:02:27.173 --> 00:02:28.006
I see.

00:02:28.006 --> 00:02:30.756
(crowd clapping)

00:02:31.690 --> 00:02:33.010
You gonna drink that whole thing?

00:02:33.010 --> 00:02:34.770
I'm waiting 'till the pain goes away.

00:02:34.770 --> 00:02:35.788
(laughing)

00:02:35.788 --> 00:02:36.660
I'm so sorry.

00:02:36.660 --> 00:02:38.080
Don't be sorry, I love that.

00:02:38.080 --> 00:02:40.442
That was fantastic, I can
dine out on that for years.

00:02:40.442 --> 00:02:41.440
(laughing)

00:02:41.440 --> 00:02:42.590
You gotta commit to the bit.

00:02:42.590 --> 00:02:43.423
Yeah.

00:02:43.423 --> 00:02:44.256
Gotta commit.

00:02:44.256 --> 00:02:45.089
The most exciting thing

00:02:45.089 --> 00:02:46.890
that's happened to me in a long time.

00:02:46.890 --> 00:02:49.850
All right, we have a clip
here from "Dark Phoenix."

00:02:49.850 --> 00:02:51.530
I don't even know that
this needs to be set up,

00:02:51.530 --> 00:02:54.840
I think government types
have come looking for you

00:02:54.840 --> 00:02:57.050
and you're seeking shelter
with some of the other X-Men.

00:02:57.050 --> 00:02:57.883
Is that right?

00:02:57.883 --> 00:02:58.716
Absolutely.

00:02:58.716 --> 00:03:00.820
I did pretty well for a
guy who's been beaten up

00:03:00.820 --> 00:03:02.700
and half drunk, let's take a look

00:03:02.700 --> 00:03:04.333
at this clip from "Dark Phoenix."

00:03:05.940 --> 00:03:08.170
This land was given to
us by the US government.

00:03:08.170 --> 00:03:10.970
We have no intention of taking it back.

00:03:10.970 --> 00:03:12.490
We're not here for you.

00:03:12.490 --> 00:03:14.964
Looking for one of the X-Men, Jean Grey.

00:03:14.964 --> 00:03:17.249
Haven't seen her in a long time.

00:03:17.249 --> 00:03:18.297
Then you won't mind if
we have a look around.

00:03:18.297 --> 00:03:19.720
Do you mind if I came

00:03:19.720 --> 00:03:23.253
into your home unannounced and uninvited?

00:03:25.730 --> 00:03:27.290
Look,

00:03:27.290 --> 00:03:28.633
I know who you are.

00:03:29.780 --> 00:03:30.890
I don't wanna fight.

00:03:30.890 --> 00:03:31.967
No you don't.

00:03:37.680 --> 00:03:38.825
Stop that.

00:03:38.825 --> 00:03:40.880
I said stop that right now.

00:03:40.880 --> 00:03:42.540
It's not me.

00:03:42.540 --> 00:03:43.373
It's me.

00:03:44.946 --> 00:03:45.973
Jean.

00:03:49.342 --> 00:03:50.175
Jean!

00:03:52.934 --> 00:03:54.859
Get down!

00:03:54.859 --> 00:03:57.609
(dramatic music)

00:04:04.063 --> 00:04:05.448
That is cool.

00:04:05.448 --> 00:04:06.977
You did so well!

00:04:06.977 --> 00:04:08.096
(crowd cheering)

00:04:08.096 --> 00:04:09.963
See, there it was.

00:04:09.963 --> 00:04:11.470
You got it.

00:04:11.470 --> 00:04:16.010
Hey, "Dark Phoenix" is
in theaters on Friday.

00:04:16.010 --> 00:04:17.160
Ladies and gentlemen, it doesn't

00:04:17.160 --> 00:04:18.963
get better than this, Sophie Turner!

